From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 19:27:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(resource-packs): decode Bedrock TGA textures

Some Bedrock packs supply entity textures as uncompressed or RLE true-color TGA rather than PNG or JPEG. Decode both supported true-color forms when loading a texture and retain their origin and alpha information so pack conversion can use those assets.
---
 .../api/resourcepack/content/Content.java     | 11 ++-
 .../api/resourcepack/content/TgaImage.java    | 97 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../resourcepack/content/TgaContentTest.java  | 75 ++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 180 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/api/resourcepack/content/TgaImage.java
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/api/resourcepack/content/TgaContentTest.java

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/api/resourcepack/content/Content.java b/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/api/resourcepack/content/Content.java
